OL,3,GNEWSAIncinerator granted permit to burn
OL,4,Amore waste types
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planned incinerator on the Dorset
OL,7,Fcoast will be allowed to burn more
OL,8,Ftypes of waste, despite hundreds of
OL,9,Fobjections from campaigners and
OL,10,Fpoliticians.
OL,12,FThe Environment Agency (EA) has issued
OL,13,Fa permit variation for Powerfuel
OL,14,FPortland to burn 68 categories of
OL,15,Fwaste, instead of just one, when its
OL,16,Fwaste-to-energy facility opens in
OL,17,FPortland Port in 2030.
OL,19,FSouth Dorset MP Lloyd Hatton said the
OL,20,Fdecision was "devastating news" and
OL,21,Fcalled on Powerfuel Portland to drop
OL,22,Fthe "damaging proposals".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
